Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Adcock
MIT License

Used here: the atomic job protocol (claim by renaming to .working, cancel
by renaming away so a job reported as not run never runs) follows the
design described in vwmcp's docs/explanation/architecture.md (no code
copied); docs/api-pitfalls.md takes over 2D-relevant points from vwmcp's
docs/reference/api-pitfalls.md.

