Vectorworks developer-scripting  -  https://github.com/Vectorworks/developer-scripting

The function signatures and parameter types in src/vwmcp/data/vs_index.json
were derived (tools/build_vs_index.py) from the vs.py stub and the Function
Reference published there by Vectorworks, Inc. Only interface facts
(names, parameter names and types, return types, categories, first
version) are included; Vectorworks' reference text is not redistributed.
